orised</b> <b>use</b>\n                                     of <b>electricity</b>&quot; under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  of the 2003 Act deals\n                                     with cases of <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>, even in the absence", "docsize": 16437, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Madhya Pradesh High Court", "author": "S Yadav", "authorEncoded": "sunita-yadav"}, {"tid": 81988974, "catids": null, "doctype": 1013, "publishdate": "2025-06-09", "authorid": 1095, "bench": [1095], "title": "The Kerala State <b>Electricity</b> Board Ltd vs The Kerala State <b>Electricity</b> Appellate ... on 9 June, 2025", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "respondent and found that an <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of\n\n <b>electricity</b> as envisaged under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act had not been\n\n made out against ... during which such <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of\n\n  <b>electricity</b> had taken place cannot be ascertained, then the demand for\n\n  <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> has to be limited", "docsize": 14937, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Kerala High Court", "author": "A K Nambiar", "authorEncoded": "a-k-nambiar"}, {"tid": 61379202, "catids": null, "doctype": 1031, "publishdate": "2025-07-31", "authorid": 1790, "bench": [1790], "title": "The Assistant Engineer vs The Consumer Grievances Redressal ... on 31 July, 2025", "numcites": 3, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "held that\n\nrecovery of <b>electricity</b> dues beyond two years without prior\n\nnotice is barred under  <b>Section</b> 56(2)  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003,\n\nand directed ... expression\n         &quot;<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>&quot; under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  of the\n         2003 Act deals with cases of <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>, even in the\n         absence", "docsize": 9017, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Telangana High Court", "author": "N Bheemapaka", "authorEncoded": "n-b