tion</b> (5) of  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  contemplates that, the assessment\n\nshould ... point of time. Explanation given under Sub <b>Section</b> (6) of\n\n <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  provides that <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>, means\n\nthe usage of <b>electricity</b> through", "docsize": 14977, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Kerala High Court"}, {"tid": 564125, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2010-07-27", "authorid": 303, "bench": [303], "title": "Udai Singh Bhadoriya vs Additional Commissioner (Admin) ... on 27 July, 2010", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>&#x27;.\n  <b>Unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> has been defined in Explanation (b), as quoted above.\nThe definition of <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> ... <b>unauthorised</b>\n<b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>&#x27; and the theft of <b>electricity</b> under  <b>Section</b> 135  is also an\n<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> for which assessment is contemplated", "docsize": 7840, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court", "author": "V K Shukla", "authorEncoded": "v-k-shukla"}, {"tid": 75630952, "catids": null, "doctype": 1002, "publishdate": "2008-09-25", "authorid": 671, "bench": [1575, 671], "title": "Sh. B.L. Kantroo vs Bses Rajdhani Power Ltd. on 25 September, 2008", "numcites": 18, "numcitedby": 110, "headline": "such <b>use</b>. .......\n \n       Explanation.- For the purposes of this <b>section</b> :-\n        ............\n        b. &quot;<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>&quot; means the usage of\n         <b>electricity</b> -\n               i.     by any artificial ... <b>electricity</b>, or\n            d.        <b>uses</b> <b>electricity</b> through a tampered meter; or\n            e.        <b>uses</b> <b>electricity</b> for the purpose other than\n            for which the usage of <b>electricity</b>",